#
# Assigned factions (FactionRegistry.gd):
#   Verdant Pulse  — 🌱🌿🌲🍂  plant growth/decay baseline
#   Swift Herd     — 🐇🦌🌿    grazer/prey baseline
#   Pack Lords     — 🐺🦅🐇🦌  predator baseline
#
# Celestial Archons excluded: its self_energy.🌙 = +0.8 would invert the
# day/night axis. ☀/🌙 physics lives entirely in this file.
#
# ALL values in this file are ADDITIVE CORRECTIONS on top of faction totals.
# The notation "[faction→X] target Y → profile Z]" means:
#   factions contribute X to this emoji/coupling, target game value is Y,
#   so this file sets Z = Y - X.
#
# Five quantum axes:
#   Q0: ☀/🌙  — Day/night (no faction → full values here)
#   Q1: 🐺/🦌  — Wolf/deer (Pack Lords + Swift Herd baseline)
#   Q2: 🦅/🐇  — Eagle/rabbit (Pack Lords baseline; eagle scarcity by design)
#   Q3: 🌲/🍂  — Forest cycle (Verdant Pulse baseline)
#   Q4: 🌱/🌿  — Ground growth (Verdant Pulse + Swift Herd baseline)
#
# ── Timescales at 0.5× real-time ──────────────────────────────────────────
#   ☀↔🌙  50s  (driven by cosine at 0.04 Hz; Landau-Zener at 25s)
#   🐺↔🦌  ~15s (Rabi: total ≈ 0.42 after correction)
#   🌲↔🍂  ~11s (Rabi: total ≈ 0.55 after boost)
#   🌱↔🌿  ~32s (Rabi: reduced from faction's 0.60 → 0.30 total)
#   🦅↔🐇  ~65s (Rabi: reduced to 0.20, detuning 0.95 → eagle stays ~4%)
#
# Eagle scarcity design:
#   With 🦅 self_energy = +0.70, 🐇 = -0.25, Rabi = 0.20:
#   max natural eagle population ≈ 4%.
#   Pauli_X on Q2 creates ~10s spike; eagle is the biome-discovery currency.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

